## [v0.7.2 – Terms of Service & Privacy Policy Pages]
**Date:** 2025-12-22

### Changes Made:
- Created `/terms` and `/privacy` pages that render markdown content at build time
- Built LegalHeader component with logo that links to /dashboard (logged in) or /login (logged out)
- Added Terms/Privacy agreement checkbox to signup form (required before signup)
- Integrated custom SVG checkbox icons (check_box_fill1_24px.svg, check_box_outline_blank_24px.svg)
- Made /terms and /privacy accessible to guests by adding to PUBLIC_ROUTES in RouteGuard
- Prevented authenticated users from being redirected away from legal pages
- Added Terms and Privacy links to user dropdown menu with divider separators
- Created shared legal.css for consistent legal page styling

